@host=http://localhost:5118

### Root
GET {{host}}/

### Get all users
GET {{host}}/api/users

### Get user by id
GET {{host}}/api/users/1

### Get missing user
GET {{host}}/api/users/999

### Create user
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 3,
  "name": "Charlie",
  "email": "charlie@example.com"
}

### Delete user
DELETE {{host}}/api/users/3

### Verify users after delete
GET {{host}}/api/users
